      "description": "Prowlarr backs a failing indexer off for up to 24 hours, and keeps it marked down long after the site answers again. indexer-retry.py checks every 15 minutes and clears that backoff, but it only writes a line when it actually clears one, so empty means nothing needed clearing.",
