      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "**Which title was deleted, and when.** qbit-manage prints the name and the verdict on separate lines, so no single event carries both, and the metrics hold what exists now rather than what happened. \"Library deletions\" above is the exception: Maintainerr does name the film.\n\n**When the freeleech lever moved.** tracker-control decides every 30 minutes what Radarr may grab, which indexer Sonarr uses and how fast autobrr grabs, and logs nothing when it changes its mind. One line per change would put both of these on this page."
      }
    }
  ]
}
